 "changes": [
  "Hull: curled bowsprit replaces the straight beam; outer planking recoloured to HullWood (130,90,55); all other hull triangles retained; skirt/waterline unchanged.",
  "Rigging: rebuilt (same name/origin/18 deg roll): broken main mast (~2/3) + tilted crow's nest, torn scalloped sails with patches, intact fore mast with nest and furled sail.",
  "New Props collection (each a separate named mesh): Prop_Barnacles, Prop_BulwarkFrames, Prop_CabinWindows, Prop_Cannons, Prop_CapRails, Prop_CargoCluster, Prop_Crab, Prop_DoorLantern, Prop_DoorLantern_Glow, Prop_Figurehead, Prop_Flag, Prop_PatchPlanks, Prop_Portholes, Prop_RopeCoils, Prop_Seaweed, Prop_SternCurl, Prop_SternWheel, Prop_TreasureChest",
  "Artifact fix: the source DeckCabin deck slab stern end face (x=-160, Y 22..24) is coplanar with the Hull stern cap and inward-facing (renders as a black band on the transom). DeckCabin was NOT edited; a proud WoodDk deck-line trim plank (part of Prop_SternCurl) covers it.",
  "Palette: 9 new cells/materials; Canvas and Red cells recoloured to the brief (used only by sails/flag). Ramp/deck/pier/rock cells untouched."
 ],
 "flags": [
  "Deck props (cargo, crab, chest, wheel, rope coils) stand on the walkable deck with NO collider: players/balls pass through them unless the build bot adds simple CanCollide boxes. They are all outside the route corridor.",
  "COL_Mast_Main (unchanged) still spans the original 8..165 mast; the visual main mast is now snapped at ~106 (+ splinters to ~113) -> the collider sticks ~50 studs above the visible stump (it is the optional mast collider; consider disabling or shortening it in Studio).",
  "Stern curl, figurehead, curled bowsprit, cap rails and hull dressing are scenery with no collider (same as the source hull/rigging scenery).",
  "Visual meshes extending beyond the source collider union envelope are listed per mesh under outside_collider_envelope (scenery, no new colliders were added)."
 ],
